Z||000000||triker||05-22-2000||07:29 PM||||Now I'll try for the double picture post.  My 87GT w/auto and 98,000 miles.  The second pic is of the remains of a wrecked 85SE w/auto and a 5,000 mile 2.8 (recovered out of a stolen 87 Fiero), and a junked Yamaha Venture.  I'm not sure if it's a Yamero or a Fieroha.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GTsideview_1.jpg">       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trikesideview.jpg"> [img]||||reg||12
Z||000001||Phaeton||05-22-2000||11:31 PM||||How does the Fieroha handle?<BR>Does it still have under steer?  With absolutely no weight transfer in front, did the rear suspension need a lot of modification?||||reg||12
